			"notes": "# FoxClient v0.1.7 (1.19)\n**New Stuff**\n- Added an IP display to the ingame-hud [`45f28c8`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/45f28c80f0fb871946bcca52cd304360ee9d3329)\n- Smooth hover animation in the Settings Menu [`1e30760`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/1e3076062a98ab6c9a8859421716c9174c1a82dd)\n- Colored coordinates on the ingame-hud [`f310879`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/f310879a2cdec6ddbeab34dd8879af9c643872d2)\n- 3 new menu backgrounds [`6981241`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/69812416d27f092e0ca303bc9dba95f314ad25f4)\n- German translations [`8d10590`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/8d10590a064ed35ade02496309904d513bde1683)\n- FoxClient badges in the tab list (very broken right now) [`34d7edb`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/34d7edb69ff2cd13ea4b723b90d8c06791eabee3)\n- Show the full version when hovering the FoxClient version in the mainmenu [`2903ed3`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/2903ed30d35c3da8054ef5b4f50695d4356d727b)\n\n**Changes**\n- Smooth Zoom is disabled by default [`7010d57`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/7010d57fd0549965145a15242ba4f1d26c4ecd30)\n- Make the ingame-hud look more like the main menu ui [`c23ed29`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/c23ed29216fb2a098dc3c42a190c6f5d2c9f0849)\n\n**Fixes**\n- World loading progressbar [`0830f25`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/0830f253e324cd81243ee3f470d7bb47fd90f1d8)\n- Splash screen saturation [`023f3af`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/023f3af6623009fa982fc61c08d3bfac85e39b73)\n- Reconnect button position [`b16e7fe`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/b16e7fed8eaf2953ecf9f2e5c8be2e4ff98e158b)\n- Konfig loading [`8929591`](https://github.com/FoxStudios/FoxClient/commit/89295918245195bddfd41639fb94ad38405db454)"
